Third-party material:
- macros/*.mac are g4numi run macros derived from the g4numi template macros
  (https://github.com/NuSoftHEP/g4numi, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Fermi National Accelerator Laboratory).
- The absorber-plane and target positions in beamline_ldm/beamlines.py, beamline_ldm/mesons.py and
  mipp/mipp_common.py are taken from the g4numi geometry code (same licence).
- The g4lbnf region rule and target centre in beamline_ldm/beamlines.py are read from the output of the LBNF beam
  simulation g4lbne (Fermilab lbne-beamsim): volume/material names, positions. No g4lbne source is included.
- The MIPP measurement (J. M. Paley et al., Phys. Rev. D 90, 032001 (2014)) is not redistributed:
  mipp/parse_mipp_table.py extracts its Table I from a copy of the paper the user supplies.
